# Giant Space Amoeba: 3/3 Germ with flying; "Whenever this creature attacks, target creature defending player controls gets -3/-0
# until end of turn, then create a token that's a copy of this creature." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with Black Lotus and two Moxen.
# On turn 3 it attacks: Bot2's Grizzly Bears is the creature the defending player controls, so it is that ability's target (CR
# 603.3) and becomes -1/2 - three power off, no toughness (CR 611.2a) - and a 3/3 flying token copy of the Amoeba is created (CR
# 707.2), untapped and not attacking (CR 508.4). The Bears has no flying or reach, so it may not block (CR 702.9b), and the Amoeba
# deals 3.

